&lt;p&gt;Ohno Akito is a military otaku. Akito dropped out of school a year ago and is now camping on a small island off Okinawa, where he went in the forlorn hope that the American military presence would give him a chance to play with real guns. He&amp;rsquo;s unexpectedly approached by a foreigner girl, Shizuka, who tells him he&amp;rsquo;s in a restricted area. That night, Akito sees a B-2 stealth bomber flying overhead, and realizes something is happening that shouldn&amp;rsquo;t be. The next day, as he&amp;rsquo;s trying to break into Kadena Air Base to get a closer look at the B-2, he runs into Shizuka again&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mahjong</title><link>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/8582/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Dec 2004 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/8582/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ゲーム情報"&gt;ゲーム情報&lt;/h2&gt;
